{"2946010": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Find the Orange Narwhal", "steam_appid": 2946010, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "Overcome your crippling hangover and work out how to get the Narwhal back! Point-and-click your way around town, run errands, and uncover the mystery. But choose who you help carefully - your decisions may come back to bite you! Think outside the box and brace yourself for a fever-dream adventure!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946010/extras/622c48a91556cd2e33657cae83db1cee.avif?t=1730371057\" width=616 height=352 /></span><br><br>Find the Orange Narwhal is an interactive fiction remake of a game originally made in PowerPoint (yes that's right... in 4606 slides). Frankly the plot makes absolutely no sense and was just an excuse to do a multiverse mash-up of game themes and mechanics. We've got everything from:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Pirates<br></li><li> Ninjas<br></li><li> Police<br></li><li> Clowns<br></li><li> Mermaids<br></li><li> Zombies<br></li><li> ...and more NPCs!</li></ul><br>Inspired by the Flash games of the early 2000s: embrace the chaos and get the satisfaction of finishing a challenge you didn't know you needed to begin with!", "about_the_game": "Overcome your crippling hangover and work out how to get the Narwhal back! Point-and-click your way around town, run errands, and uncover the mystery. But choose who you help carefully - your decisions may come back to bite you! Think outside the box and brace yourself for a fever-dream adventure!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946010/extras/622c48a91556cd2e33657cae83db1cee.avif?t=1730371057\" width=616 height=352 /></span><br><br>Find the Orange Narwhal is an interactive fiction remake of a game originally made in PowerPoint (yes that